that doesn't happen.

1467
01:07:54,141 --> 01:07:55,743
Alright?

1468
01:07:56,711 --> 01:07:58,111
My chest hurts.

1469
01:07:58,211 --> 01:08:00,515
There's no easy way
to say this, Vicente.

1470
01:08:00,615 --> 01:08:02,282
Your heart got hit
with a baseball

1471
