1476
01:08:15,128 --> 01:08:16,631
It's a one-in-a-million chance.

1477
01:08:16,731 --> 01:08:20,068
And as a matter of fact,
after all this,

1478
01:08:20,167 --> 01:08:22,804
I would go buy a lottery ticket
if I were you.

1479
01:08:24,104 --> 01:08:26,306
