1481
01:08:30,011 --> 01:08:33,648
Okay? So just lie there
and relax.

1482
01:08:34,114 --> 01:08:35,650
BP's 90 over 60.

1483
01:08:36,183 --> 01:08:37,919
Okay.
That's not a bad start.

1484
01:08:38,019 --> 01:08:39,053
